# 🚀 RootneX CyberWatch

A powerful **Windows-based System Monitoring & Troubleshooting Toolkit** designed for IT Administrators, System Engineers, and Network Engineers. CyberWatch provides an all-in-one command-line interface (CLI) for monitoring system performance, troubleshooting network issues, performing security audits, and automating maintenance tasks.

---

## 📌 Features

### 🖥️ Server Monitoring
- CPU Usage Monitoring
- RAM Usage Monitoring
- Disk Usage Monitoring
- Running Services
- Process Monitoring
- System Uptime

### 💻 Client Monitoring
- Remote PC Ping
- Logged-in User Detection
- Shared Folder Access
- Remote Disk Information
- Remote Restart & Shutdown

### 🌐 Network Monitoring
- Standard & Continuous Ping
- Traceroute
- DNS Lookup
- Netstat Connections

### 🔥 Firewall Monitoring
- Firewall Status
- Domain, Private & Public Profiles
- Firewall Rules Inspection

### 🔒 Security & Logs
- Windows Event Logs
- Security Logs
- Failed Login Detection
- Antivirus Status
- Open Port Monitoring

### 📊 Auto Monitoring
- CPU Alert Monitoring
- RAM Alert Monitoring
- Network Connectivity Monitoring
- Live System Monitoring

### ❤️ System Health Check
- CHKDSK
- System File Checker (SFC)
- Network Connectivity Test
- Critical Services Status
- System Information

### 🔍 Network Scan Tools
- Ping Sweep
- Port Scanner
- ARP Scanner
- Basic Vulnerability Check

### ⚙️ Advanced Tools
- DNS Lookup
- IP Information
- WHOIS Lookup

### 📈 Reports & Dashboard
- System Report
- Network Report
- Security Report

### 📡 Live Traffic Monitor
- Established Connections
- Listening Ports
- Network Statistics

### 🛠️ Maintenance Tools
- Flush DNS Cache
- Clear Temporary Files
- Repair Network Stack
- Driver Information

### ⚡ Quick Actions
- IP Configuration
- Release & Renew IP
- Netstat
- Firewall Status
- ARP Table
- Route Table
- Wi-Fi Profiles

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Batch Script (.bat)
- Windows Command Prompt (CMD)
- PowerShell
- Windows Administration Tools
- WMIC
- Netsh
- Netstat

