## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Windows 10 / Windows 11
- Administrator Privileges
- PowerShell Enabled

### Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/CyberWatch.git
```

Open the `src` folder and run:

```
cyberwatch.bat
```

> **Run as Administrator** for full functionality.

